// Local development spans both modules: integrations/kvs requires the core by
// a published pseudo-version, so without this workspace a change to the core
// would not be visible to the integration until it was pushed and the pin
// bumped. Consumers never see this file -- it sits above both module roots and
// so is in neither module's zip.
go 1.25

use (
	./impl/go
	./impl/go/integrations/kvs
)
